{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118545","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118545/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118545/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118545/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118545","id":4258148226,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7SIVSG","number":118545,"title":"Prevent re-entrant Main::iteration() in ProgressDialog::_update_ui","user":{"login":"dsarno","id":2432103,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzIxMDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2432103?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno","html_url":"https://github.com/dsarno","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsarno/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-04-13T22:03:03Z","updated_at":"2026-05-16T10:21:53Z","closed_at":"2026-05-16T10:21:46Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118545","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118545","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118545.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118545.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes #118544\r\n\r\n**Note to maintainers:** This is not an AI slop PR..  I'm the lead maintainer on the 8,000 star Unity-MCP project. I do use LLMs to build (like many engineers), but I also make sure changes are minimal, follow project culture, and are well tested. I rebuilt Godot with the fix and tested it thoroughly. Just thought I'd let you know.  At unity-mcp, we get a ton of slop too, so anyway, hello from a real human!\r\n\r\n## What happens\r\n\r\n`ProgressDialog::_update_ui()` calls `Main::iteration()` with no re-entrancy guard. This runs a full frame cycle including `_process()` on all `@tool` nodes. If any plugin's `_process()` triggers a save (directly or indirectly), the call chain recurses: `_save_scene_with_preview` → `EditorProgress::step()` → `_update_ui()` → `Main::iteration()` → `_process()` → `save_scene()` → ... The stack overflows after ~1000 frames and the editor crashes (SIGSEGV).\r\n\r\n## Fix\r\n\r\nAdds a static `is_iterating` guard to `_update_ui()` — if `Main::iteration()` is already running from a prior `_update_ui()` call up the stack, the nested call is skipped. Same pattern as `prevent_recursive_process_hack` in `EditorFileSystem` (#73214 / #54864).\r\n\r\n## Test plan\r\n\r\n- [ ] Enable the MRP plugin from #118544 (a `@tool` plugin that calls `EditorInterface.save_scene()` from `_process()`)\r\n- [ ] Without fix: editor crashes within seconds (SIGSEGV, stack overflow from 1000+ recursive `_process()` frames)\r\n- [ ] With fix: editor stays alive, no recursion — `_update_ui()` returns early on re-entrant calls\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118545/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118545/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}